<title>USA: Hancock Cty, Miss. corrected winner Duncan-Wms.</title>
<headline>Hancock Cty, Miss. corrected winner Duncan-Wms.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duncan-Williams said it won $3.5 million of Hancock Cty, Miss., general obligation hospital bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.6899 percent at yesterday's sale, not First Tennessee Bank, with a net interest cost of 4.685.</p>
</text>
